---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="main-container py-12">
    <header>
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Personal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Blessed by faith, guided by purpose</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 via-white to-amber-50 p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-900/80 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-900/70">
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
        I believe that knowledge, work, and service are all part of a larger calling. My life and career are shaped by faith, discipline, intellectual curiosity, and the desire to use technology to help people, build understanding, and contribute with purpose.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300">Bible quote</p>
        <blockquote class="mt-4 text-2xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
          “Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight.”
        </blockquote>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Proverbs 3:5–6</p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300">Bible quote</p>
        <blockquote class="mt-4 text-2xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">
          “For the Lord gives wisdom; from his mouth come knowledge and understanding.”
        </blockquote>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Proverbs 2:6</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/80">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">Purpose</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        I try to live and work with humility, discipline, and gratitude. My goal is to grow in knowledge, serve others with excellence, and use my talent in AI, research, and teaching in a way that brings value to people and honors the purpose behind it all.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
